{"id":"aa7902ef5b3b66c57e890f9a9b4c35841dbfa79b","url":"https://readrare.com/","title":"The rarest docs and books you've probably never read","site_name":"Buzzing","source":"readrare.com","byline":"Sahil Patel","excerpt":"Internal memos, leaked handbooks and forgotten books from the people who built Apple, Intel, Google and Facebook. Free to read or borrow.","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\">\n  <header>\n    <span><b>Read Rare</b></span>\n    <a href=\"mailto:sahilpatel200350@gmail.com?subject=A%20rare%20read%20for%20Read%20Rare\" data-submit=\"\">Submit a rare one</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <section>\n    \n    <p>Pick one off the shelf. Free to read or borrow.</p>\n    \n  </section>\n\n  <main data-case=\"\"></main>\n\n  <!-- index:start -->\n  <section aria-labelledby=\"index-title\">\n    <h2 id=\"index-title\">The index</h2>\n    <p>54 internal memos, leaked handbooks and forgotten books from the people who built Apple, Intel, Google, Netflix and Facebook. Every one is free to read or borrow.</p>\n    <div>\n      <div>\n        <h3>Documents <span>29</span></h3>\n        <ol>\n        <li><a href=\"https://greatmemos.com/memos/jackson-word.pdf\" data-entry=\"word-postmortem\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Word for Windows Postmortem</span><span>Peter Jackson, Microsoft</span><span>1989</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://greatmemos.com/memos/buffett-sees.pdf\" data-entry=\"buffett-sees\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Letter to See's Candy</span><span>Warren Buffett</span><span>1972</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://law.stanford.edu/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Intel-Convertible-Note-220920.pdf\" data-entry=\"intel-memo\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Intel Convertible Debentures Memo</span><span>Noyce, Moore &amp; Rock</span><span>1968</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://archive.computerhistory.org/resources/access/text/2019/03/102789075-05-01-acc.pdf\" data-entry=\"apple-marketing\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>The Apple Marketing Philosophy</span><span>Mike Markkula</span><span>1977</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.slideshare.net/slideshow/sequoias-investment-memo-on-youtube/37221597\" data-entry=\"youtube-memo\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>The YouTube Investment Memo</span><span>Roelof Botha, Sequoia</span><span>2005</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://democrats-judiciary.house.gov/sites/evo-subsites/democrats-judiciary.house.gov/files/migrated/UploadedFiles/0006322000063223.pdf\" data-entry=\"zuck-instagram\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>The Instagram Emails</span><span>Mark Zuckerberg</span><span>2012</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://greatmemos.com/memos/zuck-messenger-ecosystem.pdf\" data-entry=\"zuck-messenger\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Thoughts on Messenger</span><span>Mark Zuckerberg</span><span>2014</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://greatmemos.com/memos/nate-roadkill.pdf\" data-entry=\"roadkill\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Road Kill on the Information Highway</span><span>Nathan Myhrvold, Microsoft</span><span>1993</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://cdn2.vox-cdn.com/assets/4244355/DX489_Rev_03-07-14.pdf\" data-entry=\"jobs-top-100\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>“Holy War with Google”</span><span>Steve Jobs</span><span>2010</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://web.stanford.edu/class/e145/2007_fall/materials/noyce.html\" data-entry=\"noyce-wolfe\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>The Tinkerings of Robert Noyce</span><span>Tom Wolfe, Esquire</span><span>1983</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/bstj28-3-435\" data-entry=\"shockley-junction\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>The Theory of p-n Junctions in Semiconductors</span><span>William Shockley, Bell Labs</span><span>1949</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/bstj57-6-1899\" data-entry=\"unix-foreword\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>UNIX Time-Sharing System: Foreword</span><span>McIlroy, Pinson &amp; Tague, Bell Labs</span><span>1978</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/tepou-ogilvy-book\" data-entry=\"ogilvy-eternal-pursuit\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>The Eternal Pursuit of Unhappiness</span><span>Ogilvy &amp; Mather</span><span>2009</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1TZYqdFOXkZZPpMJx_16YBFkw-jaPbxiS/view\" data-entry=\"little-red-book\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>The Little Red Book</span><span>Facebook</span><span>2012</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://storage.courtlistener.com/recap/gov.uscourts.cand.433688/gov.uscourts.cand.433688.340.1.pdf\" data-entry=\"sutskever-deposition\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Ilya Sutskever's Deposition</span><span>Ilya Sutskever</span><span>2025</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.lesswrong.com/posts/5jjk4CDnj9tA7ugxr/openai-email-archives-from-musk-v-altman-and-openai-blog\" data-entry=\"openai-emails\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>The OpenAI Founding Emails</span><span>Musk, Altman, Sutskever &amp; Brockman</span><span>2015</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.justice.gov/sites/default/files/atr/legacy/2006/03/03/20.pdf\" data-entry=\"gates\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>The Internet Tidal Wave</span><span>Bill Gates</span><span>1995</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20250129034114/https://brunowatt.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/09/peanut-butter-manifesto-wsj.pdf\" data-entry=\"peanut-butter\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>The Peanut Butter Manifesto</span><span>Brad Garlinghouse, Yahoo</span><span>2006</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.allthingsdistributed.com/files/amazon-distributed-computing-manifesto-1998.pdf\" data-entry=\"amazon-manifesto\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Distributed Computing Manifesto</span><span>Amazon</span><span>1998</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://cds.cern.ch/record/1405411/files/ARCH-WWW-4-010.pdf\" data-entry=\"www-proposal\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Information Management: A Proposal</span><span>Tim Berners-Lee, CERN</span><span>1989</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://people.math.harvard.edu/~ctm/home/text/others/shannon/entropy/entropy.pdf\" data-entry=\"shannon-communication\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>A Mathematical Theory of Communication</span><span>Claude Shannon, Bell Labs</span><span>1948</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.ivey.uwo.ca/media/2975913/buffett-partnership-letters.pdf\" data-entry=\"buffett-letters\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>The Buffett Partnership Letters</span><span>Warren Buffett</span><span>1957</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://articles.sequoiacap.com/rip-good-times\" data-entry=\"sequoia\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>R.I.P. Good Times</span><span>Sequoia Capital</span><span>2008</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.engadget.com/2011-02-08-nokia-ceo-stephen-elop-rallies-troops-in-brutally-honest-burnin.html\" data-entry=\"nokia-burning-platform\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>The “Burning Platform” Memo</span><span>Stephen Elop, Nokia</span><span>2011</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://gist.github.com/chitchcock/1281611\" data-entry=\"yegge-rant\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Stevey's Google Platforms Rant</span><span>Steve Yegge</span><span>2011</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://cdn.alexanderjarvis.com/2024/09/How-To-Succeed-At-MrBeast-Production.pdf\" data-entry=\"mrbeast\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>How to Succeed in MrBeast Production</span><span>MrBeast</span><span>2024</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://newsletter.semianalysis.com/p/google-we-have-no-moat-and-neither\" data-entry=\"no-moat\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>We Have No Moat, And Neither Does OpenAI</span><span>Google (leaked)</span><span>2023</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.slideshare.net/reed2001/culture-1798664\" data-entry=\"netflix\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Netflix Culture Deck</span><span>Reed Hastings</span><span>2009</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20170615060422/https://www.apple.com/hotnews/thoughts-on-flash/\" data-entry=\"thoughts-on-flash\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Thoughts on Flash</span><span>Steve Jobs</span><span>2010</span></a></li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h3>Books <span>25</span></h3>\n        <ol>\n        <li><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1OB-J5S4g5W5Ryv456tNWW3Z2J-nc2671/view?usp=sharing\" data-entry=\"dtv\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>DTV</span><span>Michael Moritz</span><span>2020</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/distantforcememo0000robe\" data-entry=\"distant-force\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Distant Force</span><span>George A. Roberts</span><span>2007</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/poweroffastenalp0000kier\" data-entry=\"fastenal\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>The Power of Fastenal People</span><span>Robert A. Kierlin</span><span>1997</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/tandysmoneymachi00farm\" data-entry=\"tandy\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Tandy's Money Machine</span><span>Irvin Farman</span><span>1992</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/startupsiliconva00kapl\" data-entry=\"startup-kaplan\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Startup: A Silicon Valley Adventure</span><span>Jerry Kaplan</span><span>1995</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/estesuccesssto00laud\" data-entry=\"estee\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Estée: A Success Story</span><span>Estée Lauder</span><span>1985</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/kellymorethanmys0000john\" data-entry=\"kelly-johnson\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Kelly: More Than My Share of It All</span><span>Clarence “Kelly” Johnson</span><span>1985</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/insistingonimpos00vict\" data-entry=\"insisting-impossible\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Insisting on the Impossible</span><span>Victor K. McElheny</span><span>1998</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/notforbreadalone0000kono\" data-entry=\"not-for-bread-alone\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Not for Bread Alone</span><span>Konosuke Matsushita</span><span>1984</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/fumblingfutureho0000smit\" data-entry=\"fumbling-future\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Fumbling the Future</span><span>Douglas K. Smith &amp; Robert C. Alexander</span><span>1988</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/mancomputer00keme\" data-entry=\"kemeny-man-computer\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Man and the Computer</span><span>John G. Kemeny</span><span>1972</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/lisploreguidetop0000brom\" data-entry=\"lisp-lore\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Lisp Lore: A Guide to Programming the Lisp Machine</span><span>Hank Bromley</span><span>1986</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/strandnewconcept0000fost\" data-entry=\"strand\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Strand: New Concepts in Parallel Programming</span><span>Ian Foster &amp; Stephen Taylor</span><span>1990</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/parallellogicpro00tick\" data-entry=\"parallel-logic\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Parallel Logic Programming</span><span>Evan Tick</span><span>1991</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/elementarybasica0000unse\" data-entry=\"elementary-basic\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Elementary BASIC: As Chronicled by John H. Watson</span><span>Henry Ledgard &amp; Andrew Singer</span><span>1982</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/harddrivebillgat00wall\" data-entry=\"hard-drive\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Hard Drive</span><span>James Wallace &amp; Jim Erickson</span><span>1992</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/odysseypepsitoap0000scul_h6k4\" data-entry=\"odyssey\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Odyssey: Pepsi to Apple</span><span>John Sculley</span><span>1987</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/managing00gene\" data-entry=\"geneen-managing\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Managing</span><span>Harold Geneen</span><span>1984</span></a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://archive.org/details/madeinjapanakiom00mori\" data-entry=\"made-in-japan\" tabindex=\"-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopen